[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 11520.37, "timestamp": "03:12:00", "text": "没错，没错，没错。是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11522.469, "timestamp": "03:12:02", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11524.23, "timestamp": "03:12:04", "text": "所以，这完全取决于你是否愿意。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11526.389, "timestamp": "03:12:06", "text": "是现在玩游戏还是我们只想……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11528.63, "timestamp": "03:12:08", "text": "想继续聊下去吗？什么？你"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11531.51, "timestamp": "03:12:11", "text": "想做什么？什么都愿意尝试。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11533.83, "timestamp": "03:12:13", "text": "说实话，我挺喜欢这种氛围的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11536.07, "timestamp": "03:12:16", "text": "就像直接说出来一样。比如如果我们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11538.63, "timestamp": "03:12:18", "text": "我们想要的是像游戏一样的东西。嗯，但我也有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11541.11, "timestamp": "03:12:21", "text": "不知道我们还有多少时间。哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11543.59, "timestamp": "03:12:23", "text": "没关系。你是最后一位客人。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11546.63, "timestamp": "03:12:26", "text": "今晚就住这儿，这样我们就可以走了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11549.59, "timestamp": "03:12:29", "text": "好的。好的。但你得去吃饭"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11552.07, "timestamp": "03:12:32", "text": "晚餐，但你知道它就在那里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11554.15, "timestamp": "03:12:34", "text": "是的。就像我一样，我也不能待太久。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11556.469, "timestamp": "03:12:36", "text": "两者都很长。嗯，我确实还有工作要做。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11559.19, "timestamp": "03:12:39", "text": "做。我是个十足的夜猫子。所以这就像是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11561.91, "timestamp": "03:12:41", "text": "严格来说，这是我工作日的开始。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11563.99, "timestamp": "03:12:43", "text": "现在。所以，就像从……开始"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11566.309, "timestamp": "03:12:46", "text": "就像和 Jock 合作一样。地狱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11568.309, "timestamp": "03:12:48", "text": "是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11573.429, "timestamp": "03:12:53", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11575.269, "timestamp": "03:12:55", "text": "是的。我们随时都可以玩这个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 11577.83, "timestamp": "03:12:57", "text": "稍后再一起。我在这里待11个月。"}]